{"page":139,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:91","surah":6,"ayah":91,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا قَدَرُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ حَقَّ قَدْرِهِۦٓ إِذْ قَالُوا۟ مَآ أَنزَلَ ٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ بَشَرٍ مِّن شَىْءٍ ۗ قُلْ مَنْ أَنزَلَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ ٱلَّذِى جَآءَ بِهِۦ مُوسَىٰ نُورًا وَهُدًى لِّلنَّاسِ ۖ تَجْعَلُونَهُۥ قَرَاطِيسَ تُبْدُونَهَا وَتُخْفُونَ كَثِيرًا ۖ وَعُلِّمْتُم مَّا لَمْ تَعْلَمُوٓا۟ أَنتُمْ وَلَآ ءَابَآؤُكُمْ ۖ قُلِ ٱللَّهُ ۖ ثُمَّ ذَرْهُمْ فِى خَوْضِهِمْ يَلْعَبُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They have no grasp of God’s true measure when they say, ‘God has sent nothing down to a mere mortal.’ Say, ‘Who was it who sent down the Scripture, which Moses brought as a light and a guide to people, which you made into separate sheets, showing some but hiding many? You were taught things that neither you nor your forefathers had known.’ Say, ‘God [sent it down],’ then leave them engrossed in their vain talk.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"6:91"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَدَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"they appraised","transliteration":"qadarū","verse_key":"6:91"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"6:91"},{"pos":4,"ar":"حَقَّ","en_gloss":"(with) true","transliteration":"ḥaqqa","verse_key":"6:91"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَدْرِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"[of his] appraisal","transliteration":"qadrihi","verse_key":"6:91"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"6:91"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"6:91"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:91"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"revealed","transliteration":"anzala","verse_key":"6:91"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(by) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"6:91"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"6:91"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بَشَرٍۢ","en_gloss":"a human being","transliteration":"basharin","