م مَّا خَوَّلْنَـٰكُمْ وَرَآءَ ظُهُورِكُمْ ۖ وَمَا نَرَىٰ مَعَكُمْ شُفَعَآءَكُمُ ٱلَّذِينَ زَعَمْتُمْ أَنَّهُمْ فِيكُمْ شُرَكَـٰٓؤُا۟ ۚ لَقَد تَّقَطَّعَ بَيْنَكُمْ وَضَلَّ عَنكُم مَّا كُنتُمْ تَزْعُمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[God will say], ‘Now you return to Us, alone, as We first created you: you have left behind everything We gave you, nor do We see those intercessors of yours that you claimed were partners of God. All the bonds between you have been severed, and those about whom you made such claims have deserted you.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"6:94"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جِئْتُمُونَا","en_gloss":"you have come to Us","transliteration":"ji'tumūnā","verse_key":"6:94"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فُرَٰدَىٰ","en_gloss":"alone","transliteration":"furādā","verse_key":"6:94"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَمَا","en_gloss":"as","transliteration":"kamā","verse_key":"6:94"},{"pos":5,"ar":"خَلَقْنَـٰكُمْ","en_gloss":"We created you","transliteration":"khalaqnākum","verse_key":"6:94"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَوَّلَ","en_gloss":"(the) first","transliteration":"awwala","verse_key":"6:94"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَرَّةٍۢ","en_gloss":"time","transliteration":"marratin","verse_key":"6:94"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَتَرَكْتُم","en_gloss":"and you have left","transliteration":"wataraktum","verse_key":"6:94"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"whatever","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:94"},{"pos":10,"ar":"خَوَّلْنَـٰكُمْ","en_gloss":"We bestowed (on) you","transliteration":"khawwalnākum","verse_key":"6:94"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَرَآءَ","en_gloss":"behind","transliteration":"warāa","verse_key":"6:94"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ظُهُورِكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"your backs","transliteration":"ẓuhūrikum","verse_key":"6:94"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"6:94"},{"pos":14,"ar":"نَرَىٰ","en_gloss":"We see","transliteration":"narā","verse_key":"6:94"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مَعَكُمْ","en_gloss":"with you","transliteration":"maʿaku